PlatformIO test directory.

Certificate setup is documented in ../../CERTIFICATES.md.

Note: the previous contents of this file told you to hand-paste PEM text into
src/certs.h. Do not do that — src/certs.h no longer exists, and that workflow is
what let the uploader and the firmware drift onto different certificates. The
PEM files under ../../certs/<thing-name>/ are the only copy; the build generates
include/certs_generated.h from them.
